WEBVTT

00:07:29.429 --> 00:07:33.710
and I was so exhausted and overwhelmed
I would just cry and fall asleep.

00:07:34.463 --> 00:07:40.327
And the months of isolation
fostered fear and loneliness

00:07:40.351 --> 00:07:42.066
and frustration.

00:07:42.535 --> 00:07:44.525
So many hedgehogs.

00:07:45.173 --> 00:07:49.373
My best friend, this person
I love and admire,

00:07:49.397 --> 00:07:51.747
felt a million miles away.

00:07:53.081 --> 00:07:54.360
But ...

00:07:55.155 --> 00:07:56.582
he was still there for me.

00:07:56.963 --> 00:08:00.265
No matter how many
difficult feelings there were,